Baton Test

An artifact qualifies as a Marshal’s Baton if it can:

✓ Trigger the intended reasoning mode.

✓ Reconstruct operators instead of facts.

✓ Transfer across media.

✓ Continue generating novel but compatible ideas.

✓ Be recognized faster than it can be explained.

